#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/static/src/paas/components/modal/AddPolicyModal.xml:0
msgid ""
"Allow grants access per person: Include rules must name who gets\n"
"              in, so whole-domain and \"everyone\" rules are not offered "
"there\n"
"              (they admit an uncounted crowd while still consuming "
"Cloudflare\n"
"              Access seats). You can still use them in Require / Exclude "
"rules\n"
"              to narrow access."
msgstr ""
"允許是按人授權：包含規則必須點名誰能進入，所以不提供整個網域、「所有人」這類規則（它們會放進一群無法計數的人，卻仍占用全平台共用的 Clou"
"dflare Access 席位）。這些規則仍可用在必須／排除規則裡來縮小範圍。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_security_access_access_policy__decision
msgid ""
"Allow grants access; Block denies; Bypass skips authentication (no identity "
"selectors allowed). Evaluated by precedence top to bottom, first match wins; "
"Cloudflare evaluates Bypass / Service Auth policies first."
msgstr ""
"允許：授予存取；封鎖：拒絕存取；略過：完全跳過身分驗證（不可使用身分類條件）。規則依優先順序由上往下比對，第一條符合者生效；Cloudfla"
"re 會先評估略過與服務驗證（Service Auth）規則。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/security_access_access_policy.py:0
msgid ""
"Allow policy %r cannot use %s as an Include rule.\n"
"\n"
"Why: seat-based Access plans count people by the addresses listed in 'Email "
"list' rules, so a whole-domain, everyone, IP-range or country rule admits "
"an unlimited number of people while counting as zero. Every one of them "
"still draws on the Cloudflare Access seat pool shared by the whole "
"platform, and once that pool is exhausted the next login is refused — for "
"every tenant, not just this one.\n"
"What to use instead: list the individual addresses in an 'Email list' "
"Include rule. To narrow (not widen) access you can still use these "
"selectors in Require / Exclude rules, and Block policies are unaffected. "
"Bypass policies are exempt because they skip authentication and therefore "
"consume no seat."
msgstr ""
"允許規則 %r 不可以用 %s 當作包含規則。\n"
"\n"
"原因：按席次計費的存取驗證方案是以「Email 清單」規則中列出的位址來計算人數，因此整個網域、「所有人」、IP 範圍或國家這類規則會放行無"
"限多人，卻只被算成 0 人。這些人每一位仍會佔用全平台共用的 Cloudflare Access 席位池，一旦席位池用盡，下一個人登入就會被"
"拒絕——而且是對每一個租戶生效，不只這一位。\n"
"可改用的作法：把個別位址列在「Email 清單」包含規則裡。若是要收窄（而非放寬）存取範圍，這些選擇器仍可用在 Require 規則與排除規"
"則上，Block 規則也不受影響。略過規則不受此限，因為它跳過驗證，不佔任何席次。"

