msgstr "Workload 異常"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_cloud_service__workload_fault_code
msgid "Set while the service is marked running but one of its workloads (Deployment or StatefulSet) wants at least one pod and has none (#1647), or has pods but none of them is ready (#1456). Quota blocked: the namespace ResourceQuota rejected the pods. Create failed: the cluster rejected the pods for a reason other than the quota. No pods: the pods are missing and the cluster reported no reason. OOM killed: no pod is ready and a container was last killed for running out of memory. Crash loop: no pod is ready and a container keeps crashing (CrashLoopBackOff). Not ready: the pods exist but none of them is ready, and the cluster reported no crash. Cleared automatically once the workloads are back to normal or the service leaves running. It never changes the service state."
msgstr "服務標示為 running，但其中一個 workload（Deployment 或 StatefulSet）期望至少一個 Pod、實際一個都沒有（#1647），或 Pod 都在、卻沒有一個就緒（#1456）時設定。配額擋下：namespace 的 ResourceQuota 拒絕建立 Pod。建立失敗：叢集因為配額以外的原因拒絕建立 Pod。沒有 Pod：Pod 不存在，而且叢集沒有回報原因。記憶體不足：沒有任何 Pod 就緒，而且容器上一次因為記憶體用盡被終止。反覆崩潰：沒有任何 Pod 就緒，而且容器一直崩潰重啟（CrashLoopBackOff）。未就緒：Pod 都在、卻沒有一個就緒，叢集也沒有回報崩潰。workload 恢復正常或服務離開 running 後自動清除。不會改變服務狀態。"

