#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/platform_monitor.py:0
msgid "These services are shown as running, but at least one of their workloads (Deployment or StatefulSet) wants pods and has none, or has pods but none of their pods is ready, so the service is actually down. With no pods, the most common cause is the namespace ResourceQuota rejecting the pods (FailedCreate: exceeded quota): check the quota of the namespace and the events of its ReplicaSets and StatefulSets. With pods that are not ready, check the container logs and the last termination reason (OOMKilled means the memory limit is too small). The platform clears the flag by itself once the workloads are back to normal. The service state has not been changed:"
msgstr "下列服務顯示為 running，但至少有一個 workload（Deployment 或 StatefulSet）期望有 Pod、實際一個都沒有，或 Pod 都在、卻沒有一個就緒，服務實際上是中斷的。沒有 Pod 時，最常見的原因是 namespace 的 ResourceQuota 拒絕建立 Pod（FailedCreate: exceeded quota）：請檢查該 namespace 的配額，以及 ReplicaSet／StatefulSet 的事件。Pod 在但沒有就緒時，請查看容器日誌與上一次終止的原因（OOMKilled 表示記憶體上限太小）。workload 恢復正常後平台會自行清除旗標。服務狀態沒有被改動："

