#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_cloud_service__public_url_dns_unverified
msgid ""
"The service is ready, but the DNS record for its Public URL never resolved within the grace period, so it was let through **with reservations** (#648 (b)). Meant for a soft hint in the front end.\n"
"\n"
"⚠ Deliberately NOT written into `error_message`: the `t-if=\"service.error_message\"` in `ServiceDetailPage.xml` **does not check state**, so writing it there would make a healthy service raise a red failure banner — while `ServiceCard.xml` additionally checks `state === 'error'`, so the two already behave differently.\n"
"\n"
"⚠ `running` is in no status-poll domain (the status cron picks up deploying/upgrading/initializing/deleting), so the flag is cleared by the dedicated background re-probe cron `_cron_reprobe_public_url_dns` (every 15 minutes, #1159 Q16/D4; see `_refresh_public_url_dns_flag`). Service list/get only read it."
msgstr ""
"服務已就緒，但寬限期內都沒能解析到 Public URL 的 DNS record，因此是**帶著保留**放行的（#648 (b)）。給前端掛一句軟提示用。\n"
"\n"
"⚠ 刻意不寫進 `error_message`：`ServiceDetailPage.xml` 的 `t-if=\"service.error_message\"` **不判 state**，寫進去會讓一台健康的服務冒出紅色故障 banner，而 `ServiceCard.xml` 又多判了 `state === 'error'`，兩處行為本來就不一致。\n"
"\n"
"⚠ `running` 不在任何狀態 poll 的 domain 裡（狀態 cron 撈 deploying/upgrading/initializing/deleting），所以旗標由專屬的背景重探 cron `_cron_reprobe_public_url_dns` 清除（每 15 分鐘，#1159 Q16/D4；見 `_refresh_public_url_dns_flag`）。服務 list/get 只讀它。"

