"build per-env parameter). NOT a security boundary — see _show_projects in "
"controllers/paas.py."
msgstr ""

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_res_config_settings__woow_default_enable_agent_runtime
msgid ""
"When ON, a project created from /woow automatically turns on its Agent "
"Runtime Pod — but only if the platform is ready (PaaS Operator URL + API Key "
"set and a valid Default Agent Template selected above). When the platform is "
"not ready the flag stays off so a new project never lands in a guaranteed "
"spawn-failure state. Users never set this per project; it is a platform-wide "
"default decided here."
msgstr ""

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_account_bank_statement_line__woow_skip_upstream_hook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_account_move__woow_skip_upstream_hook
msgid ""
"When True, this account.move's create_ecpay_invoice() short-circuits when "
"called from upstream ecpay_invoice_tw's inline action_post hook. PaaS-"
"created invoices set this so only our async ecpay_invoice_cron (which opens "
"the hatch through the module-private helper in models/account_move.py — a "
"plain truthy context value is forgeable over call_kw and no longer works, "
"see #787) issues the e-invoice. Has no effect when company.auto_invoice is "
"\"manual\" (the upstream inline hook is a no-op in that case anyway)."
msgstr ""

