"This service has more than one owner account, so the password was not changed. Please contact support."
msgstr "此服務有不只一個擁有者帳號，密碼沒有變更。請聯絡客服。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"Reset failed and the password was not changed. Check the service status and try again."
msgstr "重設失敗，密碼沒有變更。請確認服務狀態後再試一次。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
