msgstr "此服務不支援重設管理員密碼。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"Reset status unknown — the request timed out before the service confirmed it. The password may already have changed, so it was not saved. Wait a minute, then press Reset again to issue a new password."
msgstr "重設結果不明——服務確認前請求已逾時。密碼可能已經變更，因此平台沒有保存。請等一分鐘後再按一次重設，取得新的密碼。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"Resetting this service's admin password is not available yet. Please try again later."
msgstr "此服務暫時還不能重設管理員密碼，請稍後再試。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_app_template.py:0
