"Template \"%(name)s\": \"App Admin Password Reset\" cannot be combined with \"Built-in Admin GUI\"."
msgstr "範本「%(name)s」：「應用程式管理員密碼重設」不能與「內建管理後台」同時啟用。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/static/src/paas/components/modal/OneTimeCredentialsModal.js:0
msgid ""
"The new password works right away; the service does not restart. Devices signed in with the old password are signed out, and two-factor sign-in has been turned off — turn it on again after you sign in."
msgstr "新密碼立即生效，服務不會重啟。用舊密碼登入的裝置都會被登出；兩步驟驗證已關閉，登入後請重新開啟。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/static/src/paas/components/modal/OneTimeCredentialsModal.js:0
msgid ""
"If you forget it, use Reset Admin Password on the service page to issue a new one."
msgstr "忘記密碼時，可在服務頁按「重設管理員密碼」取得新的密碼。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/static/src/paas/pages/service/ServiceDetailPage.xml:0
msgid ""
"Reset Admin Password issues a new password that works right away: devices\n"
"                    signed in with the old password are signed out, and two-factor sign-in\n"
"                    is turned off."
msgstr "重設管理員密碼會產生立即生效的新密碼：用舊密碼登入的裝置都會被登出，兩步驟驗證也會關閉。"

