#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_cloud_service__redeploy_check_message
msgid "Redeploy Check"
msgstr "重新部署核對"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_cloud_service__redeploy_check_message
msgid ""
"Result of comparing the running workload with the product template after the"
" last redeploy (chart version and images). Empty when they match."
msgstr "上次重新部署後，實際執行的 workload 與商品範本的核對結果（chart 版本與 image）。相符時為空。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_cloud_service__redeploy_verify_pending
msgid "Redeploy Verification Pending"
msgstr "等待重新部署核對"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"Deployment timeout recovery fields are managed by the platform: %(fields)s"
msgstr "部署逾時自動恢復的欄位由平台管理：%(fields)s"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the release runs a different chart than the template expects — an in-place "
"upgrade cannot switch charts; a fresh install is required (see #1128)"
msgstr "release 跑的 chart 與範本預期的不同——原地升級換不了 chart，需要重新安裝（見 #1128）"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the operator does not report Pod identity (component/owner) — upgrade paas-"
"operator first (#1263), woow-odoo readiness fails closed without it"
msgstr ""
"operator 沒有回報 Pod 身分（component／owner）——請先升級 paas-operator（#1263），沒有它 woow-"
"odoo 的就緒判定一律不放行"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the chart's server/postgresql Pod was never created (or is not owned by its "
"ReplicaSet/StatefulSet) — check the ReplicaSet/StatefulSet events for "
"FailedCreate (namespace ResourceQuota, admission)"
msgstr ""
"chart 的 server／postgresql Pod 從未建立（或不屬於它的 ReplicaSet／StatefulSet）——請查 "
"ReplicaSet／StatefulSet 事件裡的 FailedCreate（namespace ResourceQuota、admission）"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"a required Pod exists but never reached Running — check its pod events "
"(scheduling, Multi-Attach, image pull); an exempt backup Job listed in the "
"detail may still hold the RWO data PVC"
msgstr ""
"必要的 Pod 存在但從未進入 Running——請查它的 Pod 事件（排程、Multi-Attach、拉 image）；細節裡列出的豁免備份 Job"
" 可能還佔著 RWO 資料 PVC"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"a volume could not be attached to the node — check the Longhorn volume and "
"whether its replicas can be scheduled (disk space, storage over-"
"provisioning, orphaned PVCs still holding capacity)"
msgstr ""
"磁碟掛不到節點上——請檢查 Longhorn volume 與它的 replica 能否排程（磁碟空間、Storage Over "
"Provisioning、仍佔著容量的孤兒 PVC）"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"a volume could not be mounted — check the PVC/PV binding and the CSI driver "
"events of the pod"
msgstr "磁碟無法掛載——請檢查 PVC／PV 的綁定與這個 Pod 的 CSI driver 事件"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the pod could not be scheduled — check node CPU/memory capacity, unbound "
"PVCs (storage class, Longhorn capacity) and node selectors"
msgstr ""
"Pod 排不上節點——請檢查節點 CPU／記憶體容量、未綁定的 PVC（storage class、Longhorn 容量）與 node "
"selector"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the container image could not be pulled — check the image reference, the "
"registry credentials (imagePullSecrets) and that the registry is reachable "
"from the node"
msgstr ""
"拉不到容器 image——請檢查 image 參照、registry 憑證（imagePullSecrets），以及節點連不連得到 registry"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"a container keeps crashing on start — check its previous logs (kubectl logs "
"--previous) and its configuration"
msgstr "容器一啟動就反覆當掉——請查它上一次的 log（kubectl logs --previous）與設定"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the container could not be created — check the Secrets/ConfigMaps it "
"references and its container spec"
msgstr "容器建立不起來——請檢查它引用的 Secret／ConfigMap 與容器設定"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "the operator could not list pods — check its RBAC and the API server"
msgstr "operator 列不出 Pod——請檢查它的 RBAC 與 API server"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"no Pod object was ever created — check the namespace ResourceQuota (a "
"rejected Pod never materialises) and that the chart labels its pods with "
"app.kubernetes.io/instance"
msgstr ""
"一顆 Pod 都沒有建立——請檢查 namespace 的 ResourceQuota（被拒絕的 Pod 不會出現），以及 chart 有沒有替 Pod"
" 標上 app.kubernetes.io/instance"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"pods exist but none reached Running — check pod events (scheduling, image "
"pull) and node capacity"
msgstr "Pod 存在但沒有一顆進入 Running——請查 Pod 事件（排程、拉 image）與節點容量"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"pods never started (still Pending) — check the pod events (scheduling, "
"volume attach/mount, image pull) and node capacity"
msgstr "Pod 從未啟動（仍是 Pending）——請查 Pod 事件（排程、磁碟掛載、拉 image）與節點容量"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"pods are Running but never became ready — check container logs and the "
"readiness probe"
msgstr "Pod 已 Running 但一直沒有就緒——請查容器 log 與 readiness probe"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the platform never received VM status — the operator is likely too old to "
"report it"
msgstr "平台從未收到 VM 狀態——operator 版本可能太舊、不會回報"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the operator could not read the VirtualMachineInstance — check its RBAC for "
"virtualmachineinstances"
msgstr ""
"operator 讀不到 VirtualMachineInstance——請檢查它對 virtualmachineinstances 的 RBAC"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"no VirtualMachineInstance was created — check the DataVolume / CDI importer,"
" the disk import may have stalled"
msgstr "沒有建立 VirtualMachineInstance——請檢查 DataVolume／CDI importer，磁碟匯入可能卡住了"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the VM is running but never reported Ready — check the guest boot inside the"
" VM"
msgstr "VM 已在執行但一直沒有回報 Ready——請檢查 VM 內的開機狀況"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the helm release never reached \"deployed\" — a killed rollback leaves it "
"stuck in pending-*; inspect `helm history` for the release"
msgstr ""
"helm release 一直沒到 \"deployed\"——rollback 被中斷會卡在 pending-*；請查這個 release 的 "
"`helm history`"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"the service is suspended — its workload is intentionally halted, so it can "
"never become ready while a deploy/upgrade is pending (see #482)"
msgstr "服務停權中——workload 被刻意停機，部署／升級等待期間永遠不會就緒（見 #482）"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"The service is suspended, so it cannot finish deploying. It will resume "
"automatically once the subscription is active again."
msgstr "服務目前停權中，因此無法完成部署；訂閱恢復有效後服務會自動恢復。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"The service did not finish starting within %(minutes)s minutes because the "
"platform could not provide the storage or computing resources it needs in "
"time. This is a platform-side issue and you do not need to do anything; the "
"service will recover automatically once it is resolved."
msgstr ""
"服務在 %(minutes)s "
"分鐘內沒能啟動完成：平台沒能及時提供它需要的儲存或運算資源。這是平台端的問題，您不需要做任何操作；問題排除後服務會自動恢復。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"The service did not finish starting within %(minutes)s minutes because its "
"software image could not be downloaded. This is a platform-side issue and "
"you do not need to do anything; the service will recover automatically once "
"it is resolved."
msgstr ""
"服務在 %(minutes)s 分鐘內沒能啟動完成：服務的程式映像檔下載不下來。這是平台端的問題，您不需要做任何操作；問題排除後服務會自動恢復。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"The service did not finish starting within %(minutes)s minutes because it "
"keeps restarting while starting up. If you recently changed its settings, "
"please check them; otherwise you do not need to do anything. The service "
"will recover automatically once the problem is resolved."
msgstr ""
"服務在 %(minutes)s "
"分鐘內沒能啟動完成：服務啟動時一直重新啟動。如果您最近修改過服務設定，請確認設定是否正確；否則您不需要做任何操作。問題排除後服務會自動恢復。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"The service started but did not report that it was ready within %(minutes)s "
"minutes. You do not need to do anything; the service will recover "
"automatically once it becomes ready."
msgstr "服務已啟動，但在 %(minutes)s 分鐘內沒有回報可以使用。您不需要做任何操作；服務就緒後會自動恢復。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"The service did not finish starting within %(minutes)s minutes. You do not "
"need to do anything for now; the service will recover automatically once the"
" problem is resolved. If it does not recover, please contact support."
msgstr "服務在 %(minutes)s 分鐘內沒能啟動完成。您目前不需要做任何操作；問題排除後服務會自動恢復，若一直沒有恢復，請聯絡客服。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"%(summary)s\n"
"Technical details for the administrator: %(details)s"
msgstr ""
"%(summary)s\n"
"技術細節（給管理員）：%(details)s"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"Service %(name)s (id=%(id)s) recovered on its own after the deployment "
"timeout of %(timed_out_at)s UTC: the release became ready, so it moved to "
"%(state)s."
msgstr ""
"服務 %(name)s（id=%(id)s）在 %(timed_out_at)s UTC 部署逾時後已自行恢復：release 已就緒，狀態改為 "
"%(state)s。"

