"#1424: when the tenant was told (once) that this subscription is not charged"
" because its cloud service never worked (it has stayed in error since it was"
" created). The auto-invoice cron skips such subscriptions; billing resumes "
"once the service reaches running. Stamped only after the notice reached the "
"mail queue."
msgstr ""
"#1424：告知租戶（只寄一次）「這筆訂閱的雲端服務從沒正常運作過（建立後一直停在錯誤），因此不扣款」的時間。自動扣款排程會跳過這類訂閱；服務進入執行中後恢復計費。只有通知真的排進寄信佇列才會記錄。"

