#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"The product of a cloud service is fixed when it is created and cannot be "
"changed."
msgstr "雲端服務的產品在開通時就已決定，之後無法更換。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/controllers/paas.py:0
msgid ""
"Revision %(revision)s uses chart version %(target)s, which is older than "
"the version this service runs now (%(current)s). Rolling back to an older "
"chart version is not allowed because it would undo platform security fixes."
" Contact support if you need an older version."
msgstr "版本 %(revision)s 使用的 chart 版本是 %(target)s，比這個服務目前的版本（%(current)s）舊。回復到較舊的 chart 版本會撤回平台的安全修正，因此不允許。如果需要較舊的版本，請聯絡客服。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid ""
"The settings definition of this application cannot be read, so the rollback"
" cannot keep its API keys safe. Please contact support."
msgstr "無法讀取這個應用的設定定義，回復時無法確保 API 金鑰維持目前的值，因此不能回復。請聯絡客服。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "ngrok is turned on, but no ngrok authtoken has been entered. Enter the authtoken of your own ngrok account in Configuration."
msgstr "已開啟 ngrok，但還沒有填 ngrok authtoken。請到「配置」填入你自己 ngrok 帳號的 authtoken。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "ngrok is connected, but the service started before it was, so it still uses the in-cluster address. Restart the service to switch to the ngrok address."
msgstr "ngrok 已連上，但服務啟動時還沒等到它，目前仍使用叢集內網址。請重新啟動服務以改用 ngrok 對外網址。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "The ngrok authtoken is not valid (%(code)s). Copy it again from the \"Your Authtoken\" page of your ngrok dashboard and enter it in Configuration."
msgstr "ngrok authtoken 不正確（%(code)s）。請到 ngrok 後台的「Your Authtoken」頁重新複製，再到「配置」填入。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "This ngrok account already has the maximum number of agents online (ERR_NGROK_108). Stop the other ngrok agent that uses this account, or use another account."
msgstr "這個 ngrok 帳號同時連線的 agent 數已達上限（ERR_NGROK_108）。請停掉其他使用同一個帳號的 ngrok agent，或改用另一個帳號。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "This ngrok domain is already online somewhere else (ERR_NGROK_334). A domain can be used by only one agent at a time: stop the other one or use another domain."
msgstr "這個 ngrok 網域已經在別處上線（ERR_NGROK_334）。同一個網域同時只能給一個 agent 用：請停掉另一邊，或改用別的網域。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "ngrok needs a verified account and authtoken (ERR_NGROK_4018). Verify your ngrok account and enter its authtoken in Configuration."
msgstr "ngrok 需要已驗證的帳號與 authtoken（ERR_NGROK_4018）。請完成 ngrok 帳號驗證，再到「配置」填入它的 authtoken。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "The ngrok agent could not connect (%(code)s, see https://ngrok.com/docs/errors/%(slug)s). Check the ngrok authtoken and domain in Configuration."
msgstr "ngrok agent 無法連線（%(code)s，說明見 https://ngrok.com/docs/errors/%(slug)s）。請檢查「配置」裡的 ngrok authtoken 與網域。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "Your ngrok account plan does not allow a feature this service uses (ERR_NGROK_9014) — usually the PROXY protocol that passes the real client address. The authtoken itself is fine. Upgrade the ngrok account to a paid plan (Pay-as-you-go), or turn off the PROXY protocol option in Configuration if this service offers one."
msgstr "你的 ngrok 帳號方案不允許本服務使用的功能（ERR_NGROK_9014），通常是用來傳遞真實來源位址的 PROXY protocol；authtoken 本身沒有問題。請把 ngrok 帳號升級為付費方案（Pay-as-you-go），或在「配置」關閉 PROXY protocol 選項（如果此服務有提供）。"

