#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
msgid "The plan was changed, but resizing the service did not complete. %(reason)s Submit the configuration again to retry, or contact support."
msgstr "方案已變更，但服務規格沒有調整完成。%(reason)s 請到「配置」再按一次「儲存變更」，或聯絡客服。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/cloud_service.py:0
