#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_cloud_service__resume_hold_reason
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_security_access__resume_hold_reason
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_smart_home__resume_hold_reason
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_subscription_lifecycle_mixin__resume_hold_reason
msgid "Resume On Hold"
msgstr "暫不復權原因"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_cloud_service__resume_hold_reason
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_security_access__resume_hold_reason
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_smart_home__resume_hold_reason
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_woow_paas_platform_subscription_lifecycle_mixin__resume_hold_reason
msgid ""
"Why this suspended service has not been resumed although its subscription "
"is in progress again: it still has unpaid invoices. Written and cleared by "
"the subscription lifecycle jobs."
msgstr "訂閱已回到進行中，這個停權中的服務卻還沒恢復的原因：仍有未付清的發票。由訂閱生命週期排程寫入與清除。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_paas_platform.field_sh_subscription_subscription__woow_resume_payment_confirmed
msgid "Allow Resume (Payment Confirmed Manually)"
msgstr "允許復權（已人工確認付款）"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_paas_platform.field_sh_subscription_subscription__woow_resume_payment_confirmed
msgid ""
"Tick after confirming the payment outside the system (for example a bank "
"transfer that has not been reconciled yet). Suspended services on this "
"subscription then resume even though its invoices are not paid in the "
"system. Cleared automatically when the subscription leaves \"In Progress\". "
"Only billing administrators can change it."
msgstr "在系統外確認收到款項後勾選（例如還沒沖帳的銀行轉帳）。勾選後，這筆訂閱底下停權中的服務即使發票在系統內未付清也會恢復。訂閱離開「進行中」時自動清除。只有帳務管理員可以修改。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:woow_paas_platform.view_sh_subscription_form_woow_resume
msgid "PaaS Service Resume"
msgstr "PaaS 服務復權"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/subscription_lifecycle_cron.py:0
msgid ""
"Resume on hold: subscription %(subscription)s has unpaid invoices "
"(%(invoices)s). The service resumes automatically once they are paid, or "
"after a billing administrator ticks \"Allow Resume (Payment Confirmed "
"Manually)\" on the subscription."
msgstr "暫不復權：訂閱 %(subscription)s 還有未付清的發票（%(invoices)s）。付清後會自動恢復，或由帳務管理員在訂閱上勾選「允許復權（已人工確認付款）」後恢復。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/subscription_lifecycle_cron.py:0
msgid ""
"%(service)s was resumed (now %(state)s) although invoices %(invoices)s are "
"unpaid, because a billing administrator confirmed the payment manually."
msgstr "帳務管理員已人工確認付款，%(service)s 在發票 %(invoices)s 未付清的情況下已復權（目前狀態：%(state)s）。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/sh_subscription_resume_trigger.py:0
msgid ""
"Only billing administrators can allow a suspended service to resume without "
"a paid invoice."
msgstr "只有帳務管理員可以讓停權中的服務在發票未付清時復權。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/sh_subscription_resume_trigger.py:0
msgid ""
"Payment confirmed manually by a billing administrator: suspended services on "
"this subscription may resume while it stays in progress. Unpaid invoices at "
"this moment: %(invoices)s."
msgstr "帳務管理員已人工確認付款：訂閱維持進行中期間，底下停權中的服務可以復權。目前未付清的發票：%(invoices)s。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_paas_platform/models/sh_subscription_resume_trigger.py:0
msgid ""
"Payment confirmed manually by a billing administrator: suspended services on "
"this subscription may resume while it stays in progress. There are no unpaid "
"invoices at this moment."
msgstr "帳務管理員已人工確認付款：訂閱維持進行中期間，底下停權中的服務可以復權。目前沒有未付清的發票。"

#. module: woow_paas_platform
